    {
      "name": "Search Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "白玻璃底 + indigo hairline 描边 + 中圆角；聚焦转 indigo 描边 + 外圈光环。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\"><input class=\"ds-input\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"搜索内容…\"/></div>",
      "css": ".ds-field{position:relative}.ds-input{width:100%;min-height:44px;padding:0 1rem;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-strong,rgba(79,70,229,0.16));background:var(--color-surface-elevated,rgba(255,255,255,0.86));color:var(--color-text-primary,#0f172a);font-family:\"Noto Sans\",\"Noto Sans SC\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;box-shadow:none;transition:border-color 160ms ease,box-shadow 160ms ease}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--color-text-tertiary,#64748b)}.ds-input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--color-theme,#4f46e5);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-theme,#4f46e5) 18%,transparent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "白玻璃卡：大圆角 + hairline 边框 + 淡阴影；hover 上浮 4px + indigo 边框。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-card\" href=\"#\"><h3 class=\"ds-card-title\">测试百科</h3><p class=\"ds-card-desc\">从测试基础到专项测试的系统化知识，按主题持续积累与更新。</p></a>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-height:190px;padding:24px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.22);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.92),rgba(248,250,252,0.82));box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm,0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,0.06));color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:transform 220ms ease,border-color 220ms ease,box-shadow 220ms ease}.ds-card:hover,.ds-card:focus-visible{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-theme,#4f46e5) 32%,transparent);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md,0 14px 35px rgba(15,23,42,0.08))}.ds-card-title{margin:0;font-family:\"Sora\",\"Noto Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.3;color:var(--color-main,#0f172a)}.ds-card-desc{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--color-text-tertiary,#64748b)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Task Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "home-task-card",
      "description": "首页任务卡签名组件：左侧 3px indigo 彩条 + 中圆角；单目标任务整卡可点，hover 上浮 + 彩条转纯 indigo。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-task\" href=\"#\"><h3 class=\"ds-task-title\">分析需求</h3><p class=\"ds-task-desc\">识别信息缺口、业务规则和高风险测试场景。</p><span class=\"ds-task-row\"><span>需求分析</span><span>开始任务 →</span></span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-task{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;height:100%;padding:1rem 1.1rem;border-left:3px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-theme,#4f46e5) 62%,transparent);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.82);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm,0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,0.06));color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:transform 220ms ease,border-color 220ms ease,box-shadow 220ms ease}.ds-task:hover,.ds-task:focus-visible{transform:translateY(-4px);border-left-color:var(--color-theme,#4f46e5);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md,0 14px 35px rgba(15,23,42,0.08))}.ds-task-title{margin:0;font-family:\"Sora\",\"Noto Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.35;color:var(--color-main,#0f172a)}.ds-task-desc{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--color-text-secondary,#334155)}.ds-task-row{margin-top:auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;color:var(--color-theme,#4f46e5);font-size:14px;font-weight:800}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Explore Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "home-card",
      "description": "首页探索卡：Material 图标圆底 + 标题 + 数量徽标（indigo-soft 药丸）；hover 上浮 + indigo 边框。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-explore\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-explore-icon\">menu_book</span><span class=\"ds-explore-top\"><h3 class=\"ds-explore-title\">测试百科</h3><span class=\"ds-explore-meta\">226 篇</span></span><p class=\"ds-explore-desc\">从测试基础到专项测试的系统化知识，按主题持续积累与更新。</p></a>",
      "css": ".ds-explore{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:190px;padding:24px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.22);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.96),rgba(248,250,252,0.88));box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm,0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,0.06));color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:transform 220ms ease,border-color 220ms ease,box-shadow 220ms ease}.ds-explore:hover,.ds-explore:focus-visible{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-theme,#4f46e5) 32%,transparent);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md,0 14px 35px rgba(15,23,42,0.08))}.ds-explore-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:44px;margin-bottom:14px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-theme-soft,#edecfc);color:var(--color-theme,#4f46e5);font-size:22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm,0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,0.06))}.ds-explore-top{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.ds-explore-title{margin:0 0 8px;font-family:\"Sora\",\"Noto Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.3;color:var(--color-main,#0f172a)}.ds-explore-meta{flex:none;padding:0.25rem 0.6rem;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--color-theme-soft,#edecfc);color:var(--color-theme,#4f46e5);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}.ds-explore-desc{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--color-text-tertiary,#64748b)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation Pill",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item",
      "description": "顶栏导航项：14px / 400 次级灰文字，hover 转不透明；active 带 2px indigo 下划线。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item active\" href=\"#\">博客</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#\">Wiki</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#\">AI Wiki</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0}.ds-nav-item{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;min-height:60px;padding:0 0.95rem;position:relative;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.16px;opacity:0.8;color:var(--color-main,#0f172a);transition:opacity 0.18s ease,background-color 0.18s ease}.ds-nav-item:hover,.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{opacity:1}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid color-mix(in srgb,white 70%,transparent);outline-offset:-2px}.ds-nav-item.active{opacity:1}.ds-nav-item.active::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0.95rem;right:0.95rem;bottom:10px;height:2px;background:var(--color-theme,#4f46e5)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Glass Panel",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "nav-submenu",
      "description": "下拉玻璃面板：白玻璃 94% + blur 24px + 18px 圆角 + lg 阴影；条目 hover 转 indigo。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-glass\"><a class=\"ds-glass-item\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-glass-text\">测试百科</span></a><a class=\"ds-glass-item\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-glass-text\">AI Wiki</span></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-glass{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:0.5rem;border-radius:18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(24px);border:1px solid var(--color-border,#e2e8f0);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg,0 24px 70px rgba(15,23,42,0.12))}.ds-glass-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--color-text-secondary,#334155);font-size:14px;transition:background-color 160ms ease,color 160ms ease}.ds-glass-item:hover,.ds-glass-item:focus-visible{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-theme,#4f46e5) 9%,transparent);color:var(--color-theme,#4f46e5)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Frosted Lab",
    "overview": "Zenix 是一套为双语技术知识库打造的冷色 SaaS 设计体系：冷静、清晰、高效、工具感。它像一间磨砂玻璃隔出的实验室——白色磨砂玻璃顶栏与玻璃页脚界定出壳层，内部是接近无色的冷灰画布（#f8fafc）和一张淡淡的 indigo 细网格，所有注意力都留给内容本身。\n\n视觉权威在壳层（顶栏 / 页脚）与首页，内容页（博客 / Wiki / Guild / Docs 阅读页）保持克制、不卡片化，只继承 token。indigo（#4f46e5）是全站唯一的主色，承担链接、主 CTA、焦点环与强调的全部职责；其余都是 slate 中性灰。系统浅色唯一，无暗色模式。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "indigo 单一主色 + slate 冷灰中性色，无第二个 accent",
      "磨砂玻璃（backdrop-filter blur 22px）作为壳层标志材质",
      "冷灰画布 + 42px indigo 细网格背景",
      "四档圆角（8 / 12 / 18 / 药丸），交互元素一律药丸形",
      "内容优先、低噪、克制；hairline 边框 + 克制阴影，不重阴影",
      "已确认的视觉反例：苹果风（已废弃）、16px 点阵背景、emoji 当图标、重阴影、内容页卡片化"
    ],
    "rules": [
      { "name": "The One Accent Rule", "body": "indigo 是唯一主色。禁止新增第二个 accent 色（原 teal `--color-accent` 已删除）；所有渐变一律 indigo 系（theme → theme-focus 或 theme → theme-light）。", "section": "colors" },
